Subject: Cooperative Model Exchange Portal Formation

Description: Formation contract for two or more isolated inference contexts cooperatively reading identical SOP evidence and negotiating semantic boundaries through a mediated exchange portal.

@ [source_document] C:\Project\Pinky\LargeLanguageModelWalker\source_documents\2026-07-24_cooperative_model_exchange_portal\Dictated_Cooperative_Model_Exchange_Portal_Source.sop
